 Sun</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+4% Artifact bonus to Fire Spellcrit Chance<br />+20 Artifact bonus to Fire Spellpower<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Physical Resistance Rating</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Lion-headed_Belt_Buckle.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Lion-headed_Belt_Buckle.png/420px-Epic_Lion-headed_Belt_Buckle.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"478\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Lion-headed_Belt_Buckle.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Lion-headed_Belt_Buckle\" title=\"Item:Legendary Lion-headed Belt Buckle\">Legendary Lion-headed Belt Buckle</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Tarnished by time and wear, the brass surface of this buckle is molded in the shape of a roaring lion.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817042549\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.098 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.247 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4243/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28640/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9831/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstri